{"seq":2,"slug":"fuzzing","title":"模糊测试技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fuzzing-fundamentals","title":"模糊测试基础原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/fuzzing-fundamentals","wordCount":1697,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"coverage-guided-fuzzing","title":"覆盖率引导模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/coverage-guided-fuzzing","wordCount":1546,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"structured-fuzzing","title":"结构化模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/structured-fuzzing","wordCount":1622,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"模糊测试技术\">模糊测试技术</h1><p>本章深入模糊测试（Fuzzing）的核心机制。模糊测试从最初的&quot;纯随机输入&quot;发展到今天的覆盖率引导、结构感知、语法感知等精密技术，已成为发现内存安全漏洞和安全隐患的工业标准方法。</p>\n<p>三篇文档依次展开：基础概念建立对模糊测试历史演进与分类体系的认知（变异式 vs 生成式、黑盒 vs 灰盒 vs 白盒）；覆盖率引导模糊测试剖析 AFL/LibFuzzer/Go native fuzzing 的反馈循环机制；结构化模糊测试介绍如何为有格式约束的输入（协议、语法、复杂数据结构）构建高效的模糊策略。</p>\n"}